<mxfile host="drawio"><diagram name="Code changes"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t" value="Luggage — what changes in the code (screens: mockup canvas, boards « Vos bagages, voyageur », « Le coffre, conducteur », « Le coffre dans les pages »)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1100" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="size" value="&lt;b&gt;LuggageSize&lt;/b&gt; (new enum)&lt;br&gt;CABIN « Bagage cabine » 40 L · MEDIUM « Valise moyenne » 70 L · LARGE « Grande valise » 100 L&lt;br&gt;litres() and label()&lt;br&gt;A handbag or small backpack is not counted: it travels with the passenger" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#E2C76B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="70" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="trunk" value="&lt;b&gt;TrunkSpace&lt;/b&gt; (new, pure)&lt;br&gt;usable(trip) = floor(trip.trunkLitres × 0.8): rigid suitcases never fill every corner&lt;br&gt;litresPerLeg(legCount, bookings): litres held on each leg, counting the bookings that hold seats (same rule as the seat count)&lt;br&gt;freeLitres(trip, from, to, bookings) = usable − busiest leg of the portion, never below 0&lt;br&gt;describe(litres): « place pour 2 grandes valises », « place pour une valise moyenne », « place pour un bagage cabine », « plein »&lt;br&gt;A bag unloaded at an intermediate stop frees its litres for the rest of the trip, like a seat" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#E2C76B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="460" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ent" value="&lt;b&gt;Entities&lt;/b&gt; (one migration)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Vehicle&lt;/b&gt; + trunkLitres (smallint, 50 to 3000, required); existing vehicles get 400&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Trip&lt;/b&gt; + trunkLitres (smallint): copied from the vehicle when publishing; the driver may lower it, 0 to the vehicle's value; existing trips get their vehicle's value&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Booking&lt;/b&gt; + cabinBags, mediumBags, largeBags (smallint, default 0); luggageLitres(); bagCount()&lt;br&gt;Demo data: real volumes (Logan 530, Clio 390, 208 310…) and bags on the demo bookings" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEF4FF;strokeColor=#9DB8F2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="70" width="460" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="svc" value="&lt;b&gt;BookingService.book(…, seatCodes = [], bags = [])&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inside the existing lock on the trip row, after the seat checks (unchanged):&lt;br&gt;• at most 2 counted bags per place, else « Au plus 2 bagages comptés par voyageur. »&lt;br&gt;• litres of the bags ≤ freeLitres on the portion, else &lt;b&gt;TrunkFullException&lt;/b&gt; (new, extends BookingNotAllowedException): « Le coffre s'est rempli entre-temps : il reste 70 L sur cette portion. »&lt;br&gt;• no bag: always allowed, even when the trunk is full&lt;br&gt;Price unchanged: bags are free" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEF4FF;strokeColor=#9DB8F2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="280" width="460" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pg" value="&lt;b&gt;Pages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• « Mes véhicules »: field « Volume du coffre » in litres, with examples · « Publier un trajet »: field « Coffre pour ce trajet », default = the vehicle's · « Modifier un trajet »: shown, not editable&lt;br&gt;• Seat page &lt;b&gt;GET /trips/{id}/seats&lt;/b&gt;: new card « Vos bagages », three number inputs bags[cabin|medium|large] (works without JavaScript); the &lt;b&gt;luggage&lt;/b&gt; Stimulus controller turns them into − / + steppers, updates the trunk gauge and blocks + when it would not fit&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;POST /trips/{id}/book&lt;/b&gt; + bags[…]: TrunkFullException shows the seat page again with status 409, the alert and the chosen seats and bags kept&lt;br&gt;• Search results and trip page: « Coffre : place pour 2 grandes valises » or « Coffre plein : petits sacs seulement »&lt;br&gt;• Booking page: « Bagages : 1 valise moyenne » · Driver trip page: « Le coffre, arrêt par arrêt » (what to load and unload at each stop, litres per leg) · Admin: the new fields" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EAF6EC;strokeColor=#8CC79A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="980" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ex" value="&lt;b&gt;Example&lt;/b&gt; (Karim, Dacia Logan 530 L, so 424 L counted)&lt;br&gt;Agadir → Essaouira: Rachid 1 grande, Mehdi 1 grande, Youssef 1 cabine = 240 L&lt;br&gt;Essaouira → Marrakech: Rachid 100 + Salma 70 = 170 L, so 254 L free: « place pour 2 grandes valises »&lt;br&gt;Marrakech → Casablanca: Rachid 100 + Omar 2 moyennes 140 = 240 L" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F6EEF8;strokeColor=#C9A6D6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="460" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tests" value="&lt;b&gt;Tests first (Opus)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• TrunkSpace: usable volume, litres per leg, freed at a stop, cancelled bookings, describe()&lt;br&gt;• BookingService: bags saved, too many bags, trunk full (nothing saved), no bag always fits, freed litres reused, seat rules still first&lt;br&gt;• Pages: vehicle and publish fields, steppers on the seat page, 409 trunk full, lines on search, trip, booking and driver pages" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F6EEF8;strokeColor=#C9A6D6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="650" width="460" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="uses" style="endArrow=block;html=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="svc" target="trunk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="uses" style="endArrow=block;html=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="trunk" target="size"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="saves" style="endArrow=block;html=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="svc" target="ent"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="calls" style="endArrow=block;html=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pg" target="svc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
